---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Research"
  description="Research on AI, work, and business formation."
>
  <section class="cursor-glow relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="wrap relative pt-20 pb-14">
    <h1 class="text-[clamp(2.25rem,5vw,3.5rem)]">Research</h1>
    <p class="prose-measure mt-5 text-lg text-ink-muted">
      Questions I&rsquo;m exploring about how AI changes work, who gets to build,
      and what helps people turn an idea into a business.
    </p>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap pb-20">
    <article class="reveal border-t border-line pt-10" aria-labelledby="layoffs-study">
      <p class="font-display text-[0.8rem] tracking-[0.12em] text-primary uppercase">
        Working paper &middot; October 2026
      </p>
      <h2 id="layoffs-study" class="mt-4 max-w-3xl font-display text-[clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem)]">
        <a href="/portfolio/writing/new-ai-businesses" class="link-wipe">
          Layoffs, AI and New Businesses: Early Evidence from US States
        </a>
      </h2>
      <div class="prose-measure mt-6 space-y-5 text-ink-muted">
        <p class="reveal">
          When a large company lays people off, skilled workers end up competing for a limited
          number of open jobs. Starting a business adds jobs instead. This paper asks whether
          layoffs turned into more new businesses once AI tools made it easier for people
          without a technical background to build products.
        </p>
        <p class="reveal">
          Using WARN layoff notices, Census business applications and SEC restructuring filings
          across 34 states, I find that companies increasingly cite AI when cutting jobs (17% of
          filings in 2026, up from 4% in 2025), and business applications rose. But the state data
          do not connect the two: layoffs were not followed by detectably more applications after
          January 2026, and the estimates are too imprecise to rule out a modest effect.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-3 text-[0.95rem]">
        <li><a href="/portfolio/writing/new-ai-businesses" class="link-wipe text-ink">Read the paper &rarr;</a></li>
        <li><a href="/portfolio/papers/new-ai-businesses/new-ai-businesses.pdf" class="link-wipe text-ink-muted hover:text-ink">PDF</a></li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/tanner-k/new-ai-businesses-research" class="link-wipe text-ink-muted hover:text-ink">
            Code and data
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>
</Base>
